<title>USA: MicroTouch sees Q4 revs exceeding $27 mln.</title>
<headline>MicroTouch sees Q4 revs exceeding $27 mln.</headline>
<dateline>METHUEN, Mass. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroTouch Systems Inc said on Friday it expects revenues for its fourth quarter of 1996 to exceed $27 million.</p>
<p>The company said the expected revenue represents a 38 percent increase over the $19.6 million reported for its fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>MicroTouch also said strong growth in both the domestic and European markets helped boost the quarterly revenues.</p>
</text>
